# Handlebars templates: prettier's Glimmer-based .hbs parser rejects valid
# Handlebars syntax already in use here (`{{itemLabel @../index @index}}` in
# agenda-packet.hbs errors with "Mixing '.' and '/' in paths is not
# supported in Glimmer"). Glimmer and Handlebars are different template
# languages with overlapping-but-not-identical syntax; prettier's plugin
# targets Glimmer/Ember, not vanilla Handlebars. Excluded rather than
# reformatted — these are also whitespace-sensitive email/PDF templates
# where a mechanical reformat carries real rendering risk.
*.hbs
